# twinsanityevolved padlog v1 -- pad 0 per frame boundary: BOUNDARY BUTTONS(wire order, hex) LX LY RX RY  # names
# the North American disc (SLUS-20909): the inputs of hub_entry.padlog, each 18 boundaries later -- this disc reaches its
# title 18 boundaries after the European one (Title at 1280 vs 1262 with --skip-movies: its loads read other sectors), so the
# European log's START (1273) would land on the loading screen; every state of the route follows 18 boundaries later
